As awards for Irish student media go, these are the big ones. They also', 'closing_passage': 'y presentable rabble by that stage of proceedings. TN2 editor Hugh McCafferty, for one, could certainly have benefited from a hearty pint of water (and a shave, but that’s a different story), although at least Caroline O’Leary managed not to fall off the stage this year. We await 2010 with interest.', 'native_item_note': None, 'continuation_evidence': None, 'page_column_locator': None, 'correction_sidecar_reference': None, 'review_basis': 'Selected source-native DOM/body opening-ending structure inspected; no full old-corpus body rescan'}

