{'native_body_boundary': 'main.container > article.article', 'selected_raw_reference': 'work_packages/M1_source_access/24_newspaper_coverage_successor_20261006/worker/raw/e3efb72957d4a352bd4c662b.bin', 'raw_sha256_reused': '63d3106ae2f1dc2372d843283aa123a57f2ba3ced7ab6c793985e4e32a90c789', 'body_selector_matches_observed': 1, 'native_headings_observed': [{'tag': 'h1', 'text': 'Oliver G. Selfridge ’45'}, {'tag': 'h2', 'text': ''}, {'tag': 'h4', 'text': 'By John Markoff Dec. 5, 2008'}], 'opening_passage': 'Oliver G. Selfridge ’45, an innovator in early computer science and artificial intelligence, died Wednesday in Boston. He was 82.

The cause was injuries suffered in a fall on Sunday at his home in nearby Belmont, Mass., said his companion,', 'closing_passage': 'ntelligence.

“I want an agent that can learn and adapt as I might,” he once told a meeting organized by IBM. Such an agent would “infer what I would want it to do, from the updated purposes it has learned from working for me,” he went on, and “do as I want rather than the silly things I might say.”', 'native_item_note': None, 'continuation_evidence': None, 'page_column_locator': None, 'correction_sidecar_reference': None, 'review_basis': 'Selected source-native DOM/body opening-ending structure inspected; no full old-corpus body rescan'}
